# 12. USER INTERFACE AND MAIN MENUS

### 12.1 Main Menu

The main menu should feature:

- Game logo: SHIFT HAPPENS!
- Main character.
- Level Challenge button.
- Endless Survival button.
- Characters / Customisation.
- Leaderboard.
- Achievements.
