### 12.3 Game Over Screen

After a collision, display:

- Funny character collision animation.
- Survival time.
- Final score.
- Personal best comparison.
- Obstacles avoided.
- Restart button.
- Main menu button.

### 12.4 Level Completion Screen

After completing a level, display:

- Victory animation.
- Level completed.
- Final performance.
- Rewards earned.
- Next level button.
- Replay button.

